& [OperationsSafetyPack: FSC5OperationsSafetyPackV1] is the accepted boundary pack exported by FSC5
  + [pack_id] is fsc5-operations-safety-pack-v1
  + [pack_uuid] is fe886df2-7b15-48ec-a2bf-473eb20793d8
  + [source_chunk] is FSC5 operations safety envelope
  + [export_status] is accepted_safety_boundary_input
  + [consumer_chunk] is future operations implementation planning only
  + [implementation_effect] is no operations control, live machine control, command execution, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, or persistent operations automation is authorized by this pack

  = must: treat operations as typed requests, dry-run records, safety classifications, authority notices, human approval records, refusals, and completion reviews
  = must: preserve dry-run-only semantics until a separate future live-control authority is source-preserved, SJS-processed, and accepted
  = must: refuse live-control effects as records, not commands
  - never: let fixture success, dry-run success, human approval request, human approval record, projection state, or this safety pack become live-control permission

