& [ExportedOperationsBoundaryContract] is the operations boundary exported by FSC5
  + [operations_role] is safety_planning_and_non_mutating_dry_run_only
  + [authority_source_role] is SOP files, accepted packs, accepted proofs, explicit future human approvals, and completion reviews remain source authority
  + [request_role] is operation requests describe intended effects, resource targets, risk, authority notice, freshness, blast radius, rollback route, credential boundary, network boundary, human approval reference, and completion review reference
  + [dry_run_role] is dry-run results simulate and classify without live effects
  + [refusal_role] is refusal outputs preserve evidence and block unsafe operation requests
  + [forbidden_mutation] is command execution, process control, GPU control, model runtime mutation, job dispatch, credential mutation, network exposure mutation, destructive filesystem action, persistent operations automation, or live machine control

  = must: force future operations planning to distinguish described intent, simulated result, human approval state, and authorized live effect

& [ExportedDryRunAndResourceSafetyContractSet] is the dry-run and resource safety contract set exported by FSC5
  + [contract] is OperationRequestSchema
  + [contract] is IntendedEffectClassification
  + [contract] is ResourceTargetClassification
  + [contract] is DryRunResultSchema
  + [contract] is RefusalOutputContract
  + [contract] is NoLiveEffectRule
  + [contract] is ResourceRiskClassification
  + [contract] is BlastRadiusContract
  + [contract] is CredentialBoundaryContract
  + [contract] is NetworkBoundaryContract
  + [contract] is RollbackAbortRouteContract
  + [contract] is HumanApprovalRecordContract
  + [contract] is ApprovalExpirationAndStaleRule
  + [contract] is OverrideRefusalRule

  = must: require explicit, scoped, fresh, non-blanket human approval for any future high-risk reconsideration
  = must: treat unknown risk, credential boundaries, network exposure, destructive effects, live process or GPU or model runtime mutation, and job control as high or critical risk
  = must: keep every current dry-run result non-mutating with live_effect_performed false

