  + [blocked_effect] is credential_mutation
  + [blocked_effect] is network_exposure_mutation
  + [blocked_effect] is destructive_filesystem_action
  + [blocked_effect] is persistent_operations_automation

  = must: block every listed live effect regardless of dry-run success, fixture success, broad approval, projected intent, or current FSC5 completion

